  "user": "Fine. Back to that charge, what do I do next?",
  "answer": "I can take this forward, but I need you to confirm which charge it is before I file anything. Your recent transactions show two card payments to TechMart Online:\n\n- **TX-0401**, 20 July 2026, EUR 240.00 (settled)\n- **TX-0402**, 14 July 2026, EUR 240.00 (settled)\n\nWhich one did you not receive the goods for? Once you confirm, the next steps are:\n\n1. I check dispute eligibility for that transaction under the goods-not-received reason.\n2. If it is eligible, I open the dispute. I'll confirm the transaction and reason with you before filing, because filing cannot be reversed.\n3. If it is not eligible, I'll tell you why and suggest the next step.\n\nIf you'd like to try to resolve it with TechMart first, that's your call. The dispute can still be filed while the window is open.",
